<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83219" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dirt, filth</i>, in clothes or
			hair, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1259
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				305
			</span></i>; of the natural <i>grease</i> in wool, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				7.17.88
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν πίνῳ
			χερῶν</span>, i.e. by <i>foul</i> means, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				776
			</span></i>(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>patina</i> on bronze statues, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.395b
			</span></i>: hence, metaph. of style, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς
				ἀρχαιότητος π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Comp.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Alch.,
				<i>wash</i> on metals, Olymp.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.75
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνος</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.945
			</span></i>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> in Poets,
			S.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.200
			</span></i>, etc.: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῖνος</span> is incorrect
			in <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.37
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> cod., <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				672.39
			</span></i>.]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
